{
  "info": {
    "name": "Pedidos360 · Mensajería (RabbitMQ)",
    "description": "Pruebas de ms-mensajeria-admin a través de API Gateway.\n\n1. Pestaña Authorization de la colección → Get New Access Token (login en Cognito con un usuario ADMIN) → Use Token.\n2. Correr las carpetas en orden. '4 · Carga' se corre con el Collection Runner (Iterations = 200, por ejemplo).\n3. '6 · Limpieza' deja el broker como estaba.\n\nUsa una cola y un exchange de prueba (variables cola y exchange); las colas del sistema están protegidas.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "oauth2",
    "oauth2": [
      {
        "key": "grant_type",
        "value": "authorization_code_with_pkce",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "challengeAlgorithm",
        "value": "S256",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "authUrl",
        "value": "{{cognitoDomain}}/oauth2/authorize",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "accessTokenUrl",
        "value": "{{cognitoDomain}}/oauth2/token",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "clientId",
        "value": "{{clientId}}",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "redirect_uri",
        "value": "http://localhost:4200/callback",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "useBrowser",
        "value": false,
        "type": "boolean"
      },
      {
        "key": "scope",
        "value": "openid pedidos360/mensajeria.admin",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "state",
        "value": "{{$randomUUID}}",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "client_authentication",
        "value": "body",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "tokenName",
        "value": "Cognito admin",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "addTokenTo",
        "value": "header",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
